OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry at first
OL,6,Fthis evening with some bright spells
OL,7,Fbut becoming cloudy through the
OL,8,Fevening and overnight with some patchy
OL,9,Flight rain and freshening southerly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloudy but mostly dry morning,
OL,13,Fsome showery rain spreads east in the
OL,14,Fafternoon and evening. Strong
OL,15,Fsoutherly winds with a chance of
OL,16,Fcoastal gales, winds easing somewhat
OL,17,Fin the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
